{"id":"4998","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4998_main_cumulus-mediocris-with-precipitation_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示了分裂云，其具有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">深色云底</span>和明亮的白色阳光照射的上部（积云云属）。 它们显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">垂直发展，顶部有芽状物</span>，表明属于中云云种。一般来说，与中积云不同，这里的一些云正在产生阵雨，并且能看见降水迹线（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处可以看到幡状云）。到达地面之前，大部分已在非常干燥的表层中蒸发（34％RH），但是一些轻微的阵雨可到达地表（附加特征为降水性）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kairo Kiitsak","location":"爱沙尼亚Jõgeva","latitude":"纬度: 58° 44' 47'' N","longitude":"经度: 26° 23' 50'' E","date":"06 May 2014 1526 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/4998_syn_cumulus-mediocris-with-precipitation_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在拍摄照片时，一股轻微的西北气流覆盖了爱沙尼亚东部，而一股微弱的高压脊正从波罗的海向东缓缓移动。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/4998_radar_cumulus-mediocris-with-precipitation_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>雷达图像显示少量的阵雨主要在爱沙尼亚东部和东南部。Jögeva位于塔尔图市西北约45公里处。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 爱沙尼亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}